Entityx9ni:///sha-256;5JMoFar2_UPzEBYfMZSt6Z9h38TPsTHTX8TZpXZzwWAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wVgXCkBuZBCAgmXEGn0PaWXa-1GHH-BnKYtUlEhzzbQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke32000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;bJjsG7f4vPeAgA7QlIIaOj_6MyXZOZPpJ_ZkqVUekEMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd3528ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VEbROdoq7FoWhRiT0wOXP1lpn3CaD1-DLiUAzPtLw64ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RyG6ZoyoRKpbj1pSpd3U3Vpvehht6nQ0r3mKCIxnnWcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4EsHfgIZw7kQPXB5ovlM6eu1wKZkwEIHsQy9LhgSKTYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iX_S95Bbqosh56yawBynHfFWjhsoABFQiTPzysnriLkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky•The Editor's sole material defect is in the `summary` metadata field, which sits outside the article body. The Editor explicitly states "The body requires no changes." Every body sentence, heading, quotation, and citation is compliant. Returning the body byte-for-byte:

